('33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000010','Istanbul Kick Start Tour: First-Time Visitor Essentials','istanbul-kick-start-tour','A friendly two-hour walking orientation of the historic peninsula for first-time visitors.','Just arrived in Istanbul? Start on the right foot with a two-hour walking orientation designed for first-time visitors. You will discover the heart of the historic peninsula while learning everything you need to navigate, enjoy and understand this complex and beautiful city. Departures at 08:30, 12:00 and 14:00.',120,50,'EUR',16,'Sultanahmet Square, by the German Fountain','Cultural walking tour','Easy','https://tematique.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/IMG_1685-550x500.jpeg',true,'tematique','istanbul-kick-start-tour-first-time-visitor-essentials',ARRAY['Licensed English-speaking local guide','Small-group walking tour','Orientation tips for getting around Istanbul'],ARRAY['Museum entrance tickets','Food and drinks','Hotel pick-up and drop-off'],true),
('33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000010','Byzantium: Hagia Sophia & Basilica Cistern','byzantium-hagia-sophia-basilica-cistern','Small-group tour of Hagia Sophia and the Basilica Cistern with a licensed local expert.','Discover Istanbul''s Byzantine history on a 2.5-hour small-group tour of Hagia Sophia and the Basilica Cistern, guided by a licensed local expert. A relaxed pace with easy ticket assistance. Departures at 08:30, 12:00 and 14:30.',150,39,'EUR',16,'Sultanahmet tram stop exit','Cultural walking tour','Easy','https://tematique.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/IMG_1218-550x500.jpeg',true,'tematique','byzantium-hagia-sophia-and-basilica-cistern-shared-tour',ARRAY['Licensed English-speaking guide','Small group of maximum 16 guests','Ticket assistance for both monuments'],ARRAY['Entrance fees','Gratuities','Transport to the meeting point'],false),
('33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000010','Topkapı Palace & Harem Guided Tour (Skip the Line)','topkapi-palace-harem-guided-tour','Skip-the-line guided visit of Topkapı Palace and the Harem quarters.','Embark on an unforgettable journey through Istanbul''s rich history with an experienced guide inside Topkapı Palace and its Harem, the residence of Ottoman sultans for four centuries. Departures at 08:30, 11:30 and 13:30.',150,36,'EUR',16,'Topkapı Palace first courtyard, Imperial Gate','Cultural walking tour','Easy','https://tematique.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/IMG_1262-550x500.jpeg',true,'tematique','istanbul-topkapi-palace-and-harem-guided-tour',ARRAY['Licensed English-speaking guide','Skip-the-line assistance','Harem section commentary'],ARRAY['Palace and Harem entrance tickets','Lunch','Gratuities'],false),
('33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000010','Best of Istanbul: Basilica Cistern, Blue Mosque & Grand Bazaar','best-of-istanbul-cistern-blue-mosque-grand-bazaar','Three hours through the old town''s greatest landmarks and its legendary bazaar.','Explore the vibrant and storied old town of Istanbul. Capture incredible photographs at renowned landmarks such as the subterranean Basilica Cistern and the Blue Mosque in Sultanahmet before finishing among the vaulted lanes of the Grand Bazaar. Departures at 08:30 and 13:30.',180,60,'EUR',16,'Sultanahmet Square, by the Hippodrome obelisk','Cultural walking tour','Easy','https://tematique.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/IMG_0623-550x500.jpeg',true,'tematique','best-of-istanbul-basilica-cistern-blue-mosque-grand-bazaar',ARRAY['Licensed English-speaking guide','Small-group walking tour','Grand Bazaar orientation'],ARRAY['Entrance fees','Shopping and refreshments','Hotel transfers'],true),
('33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000010','Taksim to Galata with Secret Passages Walking Tour','taksim-to-galata-secret-passages','Modern Istanbul on foot: Beyoğlu icons plus the hidden arcades only locals know.','This tour takes you into the heart of modern Istanbul to be shown the unmistakable icons as well as the hard-to-find secret spots and historic arcades that make Beyoğlu so captivating. Departs at 14:30.',180,55,'EUR',14,'Taksim Square, by the Republic Monument','Cultural walking tour','Moderate','https://tematique.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/IMG_1261-550x500.jpeg',true,'tematique','istanbul-modern-city-walking-taksim-to-galata-with-secret-passages',ARRAY['Licensed English-speaking guide','Small-group walking tour','Local tasting stop recommendations'],ARRAY['Food and drinks','Galata Tower entrance','Transport'],false),
('33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000010','Topkapı Palace with Harem & Blue Mosque Guided Tour','topkapi-palace-harem-blue-mosque','Two of old Istanbul''s unmissable monuments at a leisurely pace.','Topkapı Palace with its Harem and the Blue Mosque are two of the city''s unmissable cultural and historic sites. We focus on these places so you can concentrate on their beauty and unique histories at leisure. Departures at 08:30 and 13:30.',210,50,'EUR',16,'Sultanahmet Square, by the German Fountain','Cultural walking tour','Easy','https://tematique.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/IMG_0627-550x500.jpeg',true,'tematique','topkapi-palace-with-harem-and-blue-mosque-guided-tour',ARRAY['Licensed English-speaking guide','Small-group walking tour','Mosque etiquette guidance and head covering advice'],ARRAY['Entrance tickets','Lunch','Gratuities'],false),
('33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000010','Galata Tower, Fener & Balat and the Golden Horn by Ferry','galata-tower-fener-balat-golden-horn-ferry','Multicultural Istanbul on foot and by ferry along the Golden Horn.','We have a passion for uncovering this unique city''s lesser known historical treasures on foot. The tour starts at the imposing Galata Tower and takes you off the major tourist trail to multicultural Fener, Balat and Ayvansaray, returning along the Golden Horn by ferry. Departures at 08:30 and 13:30.',240,66,'EUR',14,'Galata Tower square, Karaköy','Cultural walking tour','Moderate','https://tematique.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/IMG_3184-550x500.jpeg',true,'tematique','multi-cultural-istanbul-galata-tower-fener-balat-golden-horn-by-ferry',ARRAY['Licensed English-speaking guide','Public ferry ride on the Golden Horn','Small-group walking tour'],ARRAY['Galata Tower entrance','Lunch and refreshments','Gratuities'],false),
('33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000010','Istanbul Small-Group City & Secret Streets Tour','istanbul-city-secret-streets-tour','A sightseeing walk with a difference, designed to make you feel like a local.','This is a sightseeing walking tour with a difference, aimed at making you feel like a local and introducing you to Istanbul''s historic gems away from the crowds. Departures at 08:30 and 13:30.',180,60,'EUR',14,'Sultanahmet tram stop exit','Cultural walking tour','Moderate','https://tematique.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/IMG_1260-550x500.jpeg',true,'tematique','istanbul-small-group-city-and-secret-streets-tour-with-guide',ARRAY['Licensed English-speaking guide','Small group of maximum 14 guests','Neighbourhood insights and local tips'],ARRAY['Entrance fees','Food and drinks','Transport'],false);